35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears that consumption varies wildly between rooms, and a fixed-ahead system seems to remove the anxiety of flicking a switch.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh wow, the administrative side is a nightmare! Logging readings and templates take so much time. I don't want us spending our whole evening on spreadsheets!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,My research confirms that payments are often late and disputes arise whenever the amount changes. The current system is indeed causing resentment.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The bills are incredibly volatile, with February being three times higher than August. Also, installing individual meters would be quite an expensive upfront investment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found out that some rooms are much colder than others, and some people are even afraid to use the cooler because they're worried about the cost.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, that is exactly what I feared. If people are sitting in the dark or heat to save money, the atmosphere of the house suffers.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if the bills change that much every month, no wonder it's so hard to calculate! But @Benjamin, is a fixed system really that much better?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Victoria, the volatility you mentioned explains why the payment log is so messy. People query the bills because the jumps are so unpredictable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, exactly. The lack of predictability is the root of the stress. However, we must consider if we can afford the installation costs Benjamin's meters would require.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I feel sad that people are sweating or shivering. I want us to have a way where everyone feels they can be comfortable.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, yes, a fixed system allows people to stop doing mental arithmetic every time they use a heater. It prioritizes living over calculating.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But if we do a fixed rate, who does the work at the end of the year to fix the difference? I saw that reconciliation is a total pain!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, a yearly settle is better than a monthly argument. I would rather have one difficult day a year than twelve tense months.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Jonathan. The monthly instability is the primary driver of the current friction. We need a system that smooths out those peaks.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"If we don't have to argue every month, maybe we can start talking to each other normally again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we are converging on the idea that predictability and comfort are more important than absolute monthly precision.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm still worried about the workload, but I guess once a year is better than every single month!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,We should look for the option that minimizes the frequency of these disputes while remaining fair to those with different needs.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,We must balance the desire for stability with the reality of our budget and the effort required to maintain the system.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want everyone to feel okay in their rooms.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
